<title>ARGENTINA: Three Argentine cocaine smugglers arrested.</title>
<headline>Three Argentine cocaine smugglers arrested.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Police on Wednesday arrested three Argentine men trying to board an Air France flight headed for Zurich with 132 pounds (60 kg) of cocaine, state agency Telam reported.</p>
<p>The drugs were hidden in two suitcases. No other details were immediately available.</p>
